<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia slipped to 1.8570 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia slipped to 1.8570 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.8570 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8550 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					  June 13	    June 12</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8570	     1.8550</p>
<p> Volume traded			$8.75 million	  $24.14 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380-44-244-9150</p>
